    imported_untyped_callable_surface_param_types_nil_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN follow-up. declared_surface_callable_type returns nil for imported callables without ->, so MIR has no declared params and Cranelift refuses f64 args (Stage 3 panic at hir_codec.spl:3386 w.put_f64). Mitigated by MIR receiver-tail registry; complete fix = HirSymbol declared-param field + hir_codec regeneration + HIR cache bump. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/imported_untyped_callable_surface_param_types_nil_2026-11-12.md."

